rge for paying online with a credit card. That is not a county fee. It is the fee the 3rd party vendor charges for the service.\nCALDWELL OFFICE NOW OPEN FOR TAGS & TITLE.\nON THE 3RD OF EVERY MONTH ONLY 9am-3:30pm\nLocated at the Caldwell Workspace\n110 S Main\nCaldwell KS 67022\nMinimize\nHOURS\nTax Office Open Monday - Friday 8:00am- 5:00pm\nTag Office Open Monday - Friday 8:00am- 5:00pm\nTitle work 9:00am - 4:30pm\nCommercial Vehicles 8:00am - 3:00pm\nDrivers License Open Monday - Friday 8:30am- 4:30pm Closed 12pm-1pm Monday - Friday\nDL Testing 8:30am - 11:00am & 1:00pm - 3:30pm\nTaxes\nPay Current Property Tax using Kansas Property Tax Payment (Opens in new window)\nPay Current or Delinquent Property Tax using Official Payment (Opens in new window)\nPayment Under Protest Form (Opens in new window)\nClick here to search Taxes (select Tax tab located in the upper left hand corner) (Opens in new window)\nMotor Vehicles\nMotor Vehicle Forms\nInformation on out of state titles and salvage titles\nPlate for Vehicles\nTag Renewal Dates\nVehicle Property Tax Estimator (Opens in new window)\nVehicle Registration Information\nRenew Vehicle Tags using iKan (Opens in new window)\nPersonalized Plate Look-Up (Opens in new window)\nPrint Vehicle Renewal page (Opens in new window)\n* will only print renewals 3 month prior to current month or 3 months ahead of current month\nDrivers License\nSumner County Drivers License does not process Conceal and Carry or CDLs you must go to a state office.\nWhat to bring for an Learner's Permit\nWhat to bring for a Kansas Drivers License Renewal\nWhat to bring if you are coming from out of state\nFind a Full-Service State Office\nReal ID (Opens in new window)\nBe an organ, eye and tissue donor. Sign up to give the gift of life (Opens in new window) .\nIntrastate Commercial Motor Vehicles\nCommercial Motor Vehicle Information (Opens in new window)\nDefinition of a Commercial Motor Vehicle\nApply for a USDOT # (Opens in new window)\nYour Con